Nevertheless, a greater number of locations does not necessarily mean greater geographical accuracy. When zooming out, the automated spaCy + geopy map contains several points outside the United States or in geographical areas that do not correspond to the expected route. The LLM-generated map displays a similar pattern, with many of the same geographical outliers appearing in both automated methods.


